  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sexual &amp; Reproductive Health Rights for YoungWomen and Adolescent Girls in Ghana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is continuation of GHAB25 and will conduct comprehensive sexual education training programs on life skills, gender equality, Gender Based Violence and related topics for Young Women and Adolescent Girls. It will also support groups create or reinforce processes to facilitate access to information on services, to develop a sense of empowerment, control and hope for the vulnerable youth.</narrative>
  </description>
